SUMMARY:AI Hacks & Hops: AI Is Talking About You. Is It Right?
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**AI Hacks & Hops is FREE again!**\nPull o
 ut your phone and ask AI\, “Who’s the best [what you do] in Asheville?
 ” Did you make the list? Did it describe you correctly?\n\nYour clients 
 are asking AI who has your offering\, often before they ever visit a websi
 te. In this talk\, Tyler of Britt Creative walks through how AI assistants
  actually decide who to recommend. Here’s the surprise: your own website
  is just a small slice of what they read. We’ll cover the two ways busin
 esses quietly lose in AI search\, the signals that move the needle\, real 
 numbers from local businesses\, and how to identify the changes you should
  make now. Bring your phone. We’ll test this live.\n\n**What attendees w
 ill walk away with:**\n\n* A clear picture of what AI says about you\n* Wh
 ere AI really gets its info (hint: not just your website)\n* How you lose 
 out to competitors in AI search\n* A plan for auditing & improving your AI
  visibility\n\n**Event Agenda**\n5:30 PM – 6:00 PM: Networking\, Drinks 
 & Setup\n6:00 PM – 7:30 PM: presentation\n\n**General Event Info**\nAI H
 acks and Hops is a monthly event tailored for non-technical professionals\
 , entrepreneurs\, marketers\, engineers\, or anyone who wants to explore a
 nd discuss how to use AI.\n\nEach gathering will feature presentations\, s
 timulating group discussions\, and a relaxed atmosphere for enjoying your 
 favorite brews while delving into the world of AI. Topics will range from 
 AI integration in business processes\, marketing\, content creation\, soft
 ware\, ethical considerations\, human-AI collaboration strategies\, to the
  latest advancements in AI technology. The informal setting encourages ope
 n dialogue\, idea exchange\, and fosters a collaborative spirit.\n\nFree p
 arking behind the venue off Allen St.\nAs the event is free again\, there 
 will not be pizza served.
