SUMMARY:Ice Ice Nomad: The ADN Holiday Glide
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nThis year we're trading the usual bar tab 
 for skates\, twinkle lights\, and a hot chocolate you will absolutely post
  about.\n**No skates required. Just good company\, holiday cheer\, and a l
 ittle winter magic.**\n\nYou've spent all year buried in deadlines. Time t
 o close the laptop and do something about it.\n\nFor the 2026 holiday part
 y\, AVL Digital Nomads is going full bougie winter. We're taking over the 
 Holiday Ice Rink at Asheville Yards. It's a real outdoor rink wrapped in t
 winkling lights and festive music\, with enough holiday spirit to thaw eve
 n the most Q4-frazzled nomad.\n\nSkate like a pro. Skate like a newborn de
 er. Or skip the ice entirely and hold court by the bar with a craft cockta
 il in hand. All three are valid life choices.\n\n**What's waiting for you*
 *\n\n* A real refrigerated outdoor rink. That means actual ice\, not a slu
 shy suggestion of ice.\n* Holiday-inspired craft cocktails\, plus hot choc
 olate for the zero-proof crowd\n* Heat lamps over the bar and concession a
 rea for the "I came for the vibes\, not the cardio" contingent\n* Festive 
 photo ops\, so wear the good scarf\n* Asheville Pizza\, connected right ne
 xt door\, for when all that gliding works up an appetite\n* Most important
 ly\, a chance to connect with Asheville's digital nomad community!\n\n**A 
 Few Things To Know**\n\n* **The party is free.** Skating costs extra and y
 ou pay the rink directly.\n* **Want to skate?** We recommend reserving you
 r skating session in advance\, as popular times can sell out. [Reserve you
 r skating here](https://www.tixr.com/groups/avlskatingrink/events/avl-skat
 ing-rink-12-10-212334)\n* **Not a skater?** Come anyway. Half the fun is c
 heering (and lovingly judging) from the sidelines.\n* **Dress for actual w
 inter.** It's outdoors\, and the ice is cold on purpose.\n* **Bring a frie
 nd.** More nomads\, more merry.\n\n**Finding us**\nWhen you arrive\, grab 
 a name tag and look for the Asheville Digital Nomads sign near the bar und
 er the heat lamps.\nFirst ADN event? Perfect timing. Come say hi and we'll
  introduce you around. No elevator pitches required\, just good company.\n
 \n**When:** Thursday\, Dec. 10\, 2026\, 6:00 to 8:00 PM\n**Where:** Ashevi
 lle Yards\, 75 Coxe Ave\, Asheville\, NC 28801\n**Admission:** FREE \\| Ic
 e skating optional \\(separate ticket required for skating\\)\n**Parking:*
 * There is free parking alone Coxe Ave and the parking lot across the stre
 et is just $3.\nCome for the skating\, come for the cocktails\, or just co
 me for the company.\nWe can't wait to celebrate with you!\n\nTwinkle light
 s\, cold ice\, warm people. See you on the rink\, nomads.
